I figure I ought to be able to pass a field.types argument to dbWriteTable 
and have it passed to postgresqlWriteTable 
<http://www.inside-r.org/packages/cran/rpostgresql/docs/postgresqlWriteTable>.  
I tried

dbWriteTable(conn, "foo", dfr, append = TRUE, row.names = FALSE, 
field.types = list(Id = *NULL*, SomeData = "text"))
dbWriteTable(conn, "foo", dfr, append = TRUE, row.names = FALSE, 
field.types = list(Id = *"NULL"*, SomeData = "text"))
